{
  "$comment": [
    "Label taxonomy for the FREAK-lang-dev organisation.",
    "JSON rather than YAML on purpose: tools/sync_labels.py then needs no",
    "third-party dependency. Colours are drawn from the FREAK CLI banner",
    "gradient in src/cli/version.fk, one hue per namespace.",
    "Edit here, then run: python tools/sync_labels.py --repo <owner/name>",
    "The 'bible-sections' set is defined but assigned to no repo by default. Add it to Freak-lang when per-section conformance tracking is worth the 17 extra labels."
  ],
  "version": 1,
